findings.comment:
750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) inside microwave (plate of old food/food splash/fruit flies);
B) fry baskets (buildup);
C) spout of soft serve machine (fruit flies); 
D) dirty dishes left from last day of operation;
E) baffle inside ice machine (mold);   and
F) inside slushi machine (buildup).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled;
A) tracks of display cooler (food debris);
B) slushi machine - 1. general surfaces (debris/grime) & 2. drip tray (mold/buildup);
C) general surfaces of fryers (grease/debris); 
D) grill cooler - 1. bottom inside (general debris/food splash) & 2. pans in top drawer (food splash/debris);
E) general surfaces beneath grills (food/general debris);
F) drip trays of grills (grease/food debris/carbon);  and
G) inside 2 door cooler used for milk chug storage (debris on shelving; puddling condensation in bottom).

Clean all non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
